@startuml
' After-sale request state diagram AI draft v0.1, 2026-11-04.
' Reference: https://plantuml.com/zh/state-diagram
!pragma layout smetana
title 校园二手交易系统售后申请状态图
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam stateBorderColor #777777
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam nodesep 32
skinparam ranksep 32

state "待卖方处理" as Pending
state "待退货" as Returning
state "待验收" as Inspecting
state "退款处理中" as Refunding
state "已退款" as Refunded
state "卖方已拒绝" as SellerRejected
state "管理员核查" as Reviewing
state "申请被驳回" as Denied
state RefundEnd <<end>>
state DeniedEnd <<end>>

[*] --> Pending : 有效申请
Pending -down-> Returning : 卖方同意
Returning -down-> Inspecting : 商品退回
Inspecting -down-> Refunding : 验收通过
Refunding -down-> Refunded : 退款成功确认
Refunded --> RefundEnd

Pending -right-> SellerRejected : 卖方拒绝
SellerRejected -down-> Reviewing : 买方申请介入
Pending --> Reviewing : 买方申请介入\n[48小时未答复]
Reviewing -left-> Returning : 管理员同意
Reviewing -down-> Denied : 管理员驳回
Denied --> DeniedEnd
@enduml
